      "dcterms:title": "CENTRAL EXTENSIONS OF GERBES",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "YEKUTIELI, AMNON"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20210722",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.0083",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We introduce the notion of central extension of gerbes on a topo- logical space X. We show that there are obstruction classes to lifting objects and isomorphisms in a central extension. We also discuss pronilpotent gerbes. These results are used in the paper [Ye] to study twisted deformation quanti- zation on algebraic varieties.",
